<!--
  Spanish, written as a first pass and not yet reviewed by a native speaker.

  One line is not a matter of taste. mission_elapsed is TRANSCURRIDA, meaning
  the window has passed. It must never become "aprobada" or "completada":
  OneDevs counts days, Google Play decides tests, and a translation that blurs
  those two makes the exact claim this product is built not to make.
-->
